# Clean 3-Tier Pipeline Architecture & ETL Crontab Trigger System

## Overview & Architectural Vision

We are decoupling the application into a **3-Tier Clean Architecture**:
1. **Database Tier (`dbconnections.yml`)**: Strictly database topology per site (Oracle/PostgreSQL host, port, SID/service, credentials, Hikari pool).
2. **ETL Host Infrastructure Tier (`etlservers.yml`)**: Strictly SSH connectivity and credentials for physical/virtual ETL servers (host, `sshPort: 22`, credentials, timeout).
3. **Pipeline & Job Orchestration Tier (`etljobs.yml`)**: The single source of truth for pipelines and reload jobs. Each pipeline binds:
   - Target database `site` (references `dbconnections.yml`)
   - Target ETL `server` (references `etlservers.yml`)
   - DataPort CP `socketPort` and `configName` (for exact crontab discovery/grep)
   - `rerunPeriodMinutes` (optional rerun delay: 0 = single run, >0 = rerun after N minutes)
   - Stage progression sequence (`CP` $\rightarrow$ `PPLOG` $\rightarrow$ `EXENSIO`, timeouts, and dependencies)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph Tier1 ["1. Database Tier (dbconnections.yml)"]
        DB["Site Database Connections\n(host, port, credentials, Hikari)"]
    end

    subgraph Tier2 ["2. Infrastructure Tier (etlservers.yml)"]
        SRV["ETL SSH Servers\n(host, sshPort: 22, user, password, timeout)"]
    end

    subgraph Tier3 ["3. Pipeline & Job Tier (etljobs.yml)"]
        PIPE["Pipelines & Jobs\n- pipelineKey: 'CEBU-CP-DEFAULT'\n- site: 'CEBU-PROD' -> dbconnections\n- server: 'CEBU-PROD' -> etlservers\n- socketPort: 60170 & configName: 'CPYQSP'\n- rerunPeriodMinutes: 5\n- stages: [CP, PPLOG, EXENSIO]"]
    end

    subgraph Lifecycle ["4. Pipeline Execution Lifecycle"]
        DISC["1. SSH Crontab Discovery\n(crontab -l | grep socketPort + configName)"]
        TRIG["2. Trigger & Rerun Timer\n(Run command once + optional rerun delay)"]
        CP_STG["3. CP Stage (Elasticsearch Log Verification)"]
        PP_STG["4. PPLOG Stage (refdb.pp_log Verification)"]
        EX_STG["5. EXENSIO Stage (Exensio API Verification)"]
        DONE["6. COMPLETE / DONE"]
    end

    subgraph Observability ["5. Observability & Tracking"]
        SESS["Stage Sessions & Audit Trail"]
        DASH["Dashboard & SSE Live Monitoring"]
        REP["Reload Reports"]
    end

    PIPE -->|Resolves DB config| DB
    PIPE -->|Resolves SSH config| SRV
    PIPE --> DISC
    DISC --> TRIG
    TRIG --> CP_STG --> PP_STG --> EX_STG --> DONE
    TRIG & CP_STG & PP_STG & EX_STG --> SESS
    SESS --> DASH
    SESS --> REP
```

