## Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Pipeline & Job Configuration (`etljobs.yml`)

#### [MODIFY] [etljobs.yml](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/backend/src/main/resources/etljobs.yml)
Transform `etljobs.yml` from sample/mock into the production definition of pipelines:

```yaml
# Pipeline & ETL Job Definitions
# Links each pipeline to its DB site (dbconnections.yml) and ETL host (etlservers.yml)

pipelines:
  - pipelineKey: "CEBU-CP-DEFAULT"
    site: "CEBU-PROD"              # References dbconnections.yml
    server: "CEBU-PROD"            # References etlservers.yml
    socketPort: 60170              # DataPort Command Processor port for crontab grep
    configName: "CPYQSP"           # DataPort config name for crontab grep
    rerunPeriodMinutes: 5          # 0 = single run, >0 = rerun after N minutes
    stages:
      - name: cp
        type: CP
        timeoutMinutes: 30
      - name: pplog
        type: PPLOG
        dependsOn: [cp]
        timeoutMinutes: 20
      - name: exensio
        type: EXENSIO
        dependsOn: [pplog]
        timeoutMinutes: 60

  - pipelineKey: "CZ4-CZ2-DEFAULT"
    site: "CZ4-CZ2-PROD"
    server: "CZ4-CZ2-PROD"
    socketPort: 60170
    configName: "svcCZ4MFGP"
    rerunPeriodMinutes: 0
    stages:
      - name: cp
        type: CP
        timeoutMinutes: 30
      - name: pplog
        type: PPLOG
        timeoutMinutes: 25
      - name: exensio
        type: EXENSIO
        dependsOn: [cp]
        timeoutMinutes: 60
```

#### [MODIFY] [PipelineConfig.java](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/backend/src/main/java/com/onsemi/cim/apps/exensio/exensioreload/pipeline/PipelineConfig.java)
Update `PipelineConfig` to store the complete pipeline context:
- `pipelineKey`: String (unique identifier)
- `site`: String (target DB site)
- `server`: String (target ETL server key in `etlservers.yml`)
- `socketPort`: Integer (DataPort CP port)
- `configName`: String (DataPort CP config name)
- `rerunPeriodMinutes`: Integer (rerun delay)
- `stages`: List of `StageDefinition`
- `stagesByName`: Map of stage name to `StageDefinition`

#### [MODIFY] [PipelineConfigLoader.java](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/backend/src/main/java/com/onsemi/cim/apps/exensio/exensioreload/pipeline/PipelineConfigLoader.java)
- Primary source: Load and parse `pipelines` from `etljobs.yml`.
- Fallback / Backward Compatibility: If a site isn't found in `etljobs.yml`, check `dbconnections.yml` so legacy configurations continue to function without disruption.
- Build lookups:
  - `getPipeline(String pipelineKey)`
  - `getPipelinesForSite(String site)`
  - `getDefaultPipelineForSite(String site)`

#### [MODIFY] [PipelineConfigCache.java](file:///c:/Users/fg8n8x/Desktop/wip/exensioreload/backend/src/main/java/com/onsemi/cim/apps/exensio/exensioreload/pipeline/PipelineConfigCache.java)
- Cache pipeline definitions with lookup by `pipelineKey` and by `site`.

